WEBVTT

00:32:28.583 --> 00:32:33.018
that's why economic diversification
is literally embedded

00:32:33.042 --> 00:32:36.893
into the Paris Agreement
as an invitation for Saudi Arabia.

00:32:36.917 --> 00:32:38.893
AG: Wow, wait, so are you saying

00:32:38.917 --> 00:32:41.684
one of the key turning points
in the Paris negotiations

00:32:41.708 --> 00:32:43.351
happened on a napkin?

00:32:43.375 --> 00:32:47.851
CF: Yeah, and I really wish
that I had kept that napkin, but --

00:32:47.875 --> 00:32:49.976
AG: So what was the negotiating strategy

00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:51.684
that led to that napkin?

00:32:51.708 --> 00:32:53.809
CF: No, no, no,
not a negotiation strategy.

00:32:53.833 --> 00:32:56.809
I mean, I call it
my understanding strategy

00:32:56.833 --> 00:32:59.934
was to really understand
how do they see the world?

00:32:59.958 --> 00:33:01.684
AG: What kind of negotiator shows up